# AI-BEM-Workflow

Official repository for the paper:

**An AI-assisted workflow for generative building design and energy modeling:  
Converting natural language design intent and images into 3D building energy model inputs**

**Authors:** Shikang Wen and Qingyan Chen  
**Journal:** *Advanced Engineering Informatics*

---

## Overview

This repository accompanies the study on an AI-assisted workflow that connects natural-language design intent and building images with simulation-ready building energy model geometry.

The workflow integrates:

- AI-assisted architectural image generation and preprocessing
- Image-to-3D reconstruction using Hunyuan3D-2.1
- GraphSAGE-based building component segmentation
- Mesh-to-EnergyPlus geometry conversion
- EnergyPlus-based building energy simulation

